32:["$","div","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 rounded-lg border-l-[3px] border-accent bg-accent/10 px-4 py-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"className":"mt-0.5 select-none text-lg","children":"✎"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.6] text-ink/90","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-hand text-lg font-bold text-accent","children":["Note",": "]}],"The browser knows its own IP and port, and the destination port (443 from HTTPS). The one thing it still has to find is the destination IP, that is the next step."]}]]}]
